 "check": {
  "describe": "At the default (fontSize 14) the card is about 120 px tall; system_variables {33: 21} (1.5x) makes the text and the button larger and the card taller. Resized, the card fills the width; in a narrow box the title and body wrap and the card grows taller.",
  "render": {
